# Fullscreen renderer: a permission prompt, allowed once.
name: fs-tool-approval
size: 100x30
args: --permission-mode default
prompt: Create the marker file
files: ../../../testdata/fixtures/12/app
script: scripts/tool-approval.json
settings: {"tui": "fullscreen"}
parity: VW-15, PD-01, PD-02
---
ready
wait_for 30s touch parity-marker.txt
wait_for 30s 1. Yes
settle
checkpoint permission-prompt
keys enter
wait_for 30s Created parity-marker.txt.
settle
checkpoint allowed
